This project includes code adapted from MiroFish
(https://github.com/666ghj/MiroFish, commit 7657031, AGPL-3.0).
Files containing adapted code carry a header saying so. They were
modified on 2026-10-30: comments translated, async wrappers added,
and the code was fitted to Crowdpod's persona and reaction models.

Adapted files:
  backend/src/crowdpod/llm/openai_compat.py  (LLM client, JSON-mode fallback, response parsing)
  backend/src/crowdpod/llm/json_utils.py     (value coercion, truncated-JSON repair)
  backend/src/crowdpod/retry.py              (async retry with backoff)
  backend/src/crowdpod/models.py             (persona identity/behaviour field split)
